# APIs

## POST /pipeline/start

Request

```json
{
  "projectPath": "C:\\Projects\\AngularApp",
  "targetVersion": 20
}
```

Success

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Pipeline completed successfully."
}
```

Failure

```json
{
  "success": false,
  "message": "Pipeline execution failed."
}
```

---

## GET /pipeline/progress

Returns current pipeline status.

